1
00:00:03,267 --> 00:00:08,211
When your administrator turns on the User Time Zone feature, each person can

2
00:00:08,211 --> 00:00:10,381
have a time zone of their own.

3
00:00:10,381 --> 00:00:13,517
Open Access Control, Users, and edit a person.

4
00:00:14,002 --> 00:00:19,877
The Default Time Zone menu lists the same friendly names, and Use site's time zone.

5
00:00:19,877 --> 00:00:23,375
Choose one, here India Standard Time, and save.

6
00:00:23,375 --> 00:00:27,732
From then on, this person sees dates and times in that zone.

7
00:00:28,223 --> 00:00:31,723
People who do not choose one see the site's time zone.

